<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9483] JDBC/ODBC thin drivers protocol versions compatibility</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9483</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Initially MVCC feature was aimed to 2.5 version but cannot be released earlier than in scope of 2.7&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are several protocol versions checks that do their stuff for 2.5.0 version instead of 2.7.0 (for example: &lt;tt&gt;JdbcConnectionContext#initializeFromHandshake&lt;/tt&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need to identify such places and fix them.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
